			"notes": "Long due port of MapMipMapMod, with some fixes.\n\n- Fixed the map preview UVs being out of sync with atlas resizing. This only affected previews on inventories (Cartography table UI, MapInSlot Mod UI...)\n- Port to 26.1 and its sub-versions. Migrating mappings wasn't as hard as I initially thought.\n\nAs for Minecraft 26.2 going forwards, there are a lot of internal rendering rewrites, since Minecraft is moving from OpenGL to Vulkan backend to render stuff. As of now, MapMipMapMod is only compatible with OpenGL. If you want a port to newer versions, expect either to take a long time or not being able to use it with Vulkan."
		},
